      "machineText": "這個版本遠遠超出我原先的期待。希望它能帶給你如同我們開發它時所感受到的那般喜悅。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "This release is more than I'd ever expected it to be. I hope it gives you as\\ much pleasure as it ha…",
