      "machineText": "一路走到 v2，我們付出了巨大的努力。從最初的 alpha 版本到今天正式發布，共有 89\\\n位貢獻者提交了約 2200 次 commit；此外，還有非常多人提供了翻譯、測試、意見回饋，並在\\\n討論論壇和問題追蹤器上協助大家。我由衷感謝你們每一位。我也要特別感謝所有\\\n專案贊助者提供指導、建議和意見回饋。你們所做的一切都讓我深深感激。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Getting to v2 has been a huge effort. There have been ~2200 commits by 89\\ contributors between the …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0026-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "7b6a4778afa51184a13cfe7467046bdbe5080dbd3b2e89d5859945d1aa7e9e93",
      "targetHash": "2ce040acb59f43578e879a196c5be2932286b137f5f2a242f3a70d544e225ec0",
      "machineHash": "2ce040acb59f43578e879a196c5be2932286b137f5f2a242f3a70d544e225ec0",
      "machineText": "我想特別提到幾位：",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "There are a few people I'd like to give special mention to:",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0027-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "f88f4527e5f731cd5c8b2b3b15c6dc2beb9d8b928344981cc2fa217a4749b727",
      "targetHash": "e7ce294b8e779ec8bac88d8ee9737c997be4f148aff543cc0e262a6b24c44698",
      "machineHash": "e7ce294b8e779ec8bac88d8ee9737c997be4f148aff543cc0e262a6b24c44698",
      "machineText": "首先，要向[@stffabi](https://github.com/stffabi)致上*萬分*感謝。他做出了許多讓所有人受益的貢獻，也為眾多問題提供了大量支援。他提供了多項關鍵功能，例如外部開發伺服器支援；這讓我們得以運用[Vite](https://vitejs.dev/)的強大能力，徹底改變了我們提供的開發模式。可以毫不誇張地說，如果沒有他的[卓越貢獻](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/commits?author=stffabi\u0026since=2020-01-04)，Wails v2 會是個遜色許多的版本。真的非常感謝你，@stffabi！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Firstly, a *huge* thank you to [@stffabi](https://github.com/stffabi) who has\\ provided so many cont…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0028-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "a580b12dc1f4af1f94f8d6f9c15f96963daccab598d8dc16b976968034cfb5a0",
      "targetHash": "9fa6c1af880a876bdbadf6fdb128b9369828f2a0248908b59aaa9144892f01bd",
      "machineHash": "9fa6c1af880a876bdbadf6fdb128b9369828f2a0248908b59aaa9144892f01bd",
      "machineText": "我也要大力感謝[@misitebao](https://github.com/misitebao)。他不辭辛勞地維護網站、提供中文翻譯、管理 Crowdin，並協助新譯者快速上手。這是一項極其重要的工作，我非常感謝他為此投入的所有時間與心力！你太厲害了！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "I'd also like to give a huge shout-out to\\ [@misitebao](https://github.com/misitebao) who has tirele…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0029-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "81b347e42070cd5d325910c5e0a94c0fcfe9b749920fa01eb4d10168ead32dd8",
      "targetHash": "197b438c98b0e2b832616676823325792b21c2d98cb51e57d2b4d5c5137dbd8d",
      "machineHash": "197b438c98b0e2b832616676823325792b21c2d98cb51e57d2b4d5c5137dbd8d",
      "machineText": "最後同樣重要的是，非常感謝 Mat Ryer 在 v2 開發期間提供建議與支援。我們曾使用 v2 的早期 Alpha 版共同開發 xBar，這不僅有助於確立 v2 的發展方向，也讓我了解早期版本中的一些設計缺陷。我很高興宣布，自今天起，我們將開始把 xBar 移植到 Wails v2，它也將成為本專案的旗艦應用程式。謝謝你，Mat！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Last, but not least, a huge thank you to Mat Ryer who has provided advice and\\ support during the de…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0030-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "a5a19ce0ba93ef361f16457839441bb17edbf415aa0545afb874ade1b4d79b4a",
      "targetHash": "2c69a3586e132c3750ad9b4fd6e2de338782d3c2a940de2c6ec56f8377418e19",
      "machineHash": "2c69a3586e132c3750ad9b4fd6e2de338782d3c2a940de2c6ec56f8377418e19",
      "machineText": "經驗與教訓",
